    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), right after an enemy unit selects its targets. Pick 1 **POXWALKERS** unit of yours that is a target of 1 or more of those attacks.\n\nAfter the attacking unit finishes fighting:\n\n- roll a D6 per model in your unit those attacks destroyed; each 6 inflicts 1 [mortal wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) on the attacking unit\n- if your unit survived, enemy models these mortal wounds destroy count as destroyed by attacks from models in your unit for [Curse of the Walking Pox](vsdata:ability/death-guard.poxwalkers.curse-of-the-walking-pox)",
